  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your pre-emptive retaliations can prevent attacks against you.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Panther Parry<sup>UC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> If your retaliatory unarmed strike deals damage to an opponent, you add one-half your mythic tier (minimum 1) to your attacker’s penalty on their attack and damage roll, or you may spend one use of mythic power to negate the triggering attack of opportunity completely.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-n-z-feats#toc16\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
